# AMD64 thunk export spec -- gdiplus.dll.
#
# 2026-08-15 second-game pass: DOOM's Vulkan build imports this and it had no
# guest thunk, so the loader found the native ppc64 module and refused it
# (c000007b), which is correct and unhelpful.  Generated from the module's own
# .spec like every other one.
DLL gdiplus.dll
FROM-SPEC auto

# All 618 eligible exports were refused as "no declaration in any Wine
# header", so the module emitted had none: it loads and every import of it
# binds to a sentinel.  DOOM imports 22 of them (GdiplusStartup, GdipAlloc,
# GdipCreateFromHDC and the image surface around them).  gdiplus.h is the
# right header rather than gdiplusflat.h: the flat header is a fragment that
# names GpStatus, REAL and every Gp* handle without declaring any of them,
# and gdiplus.h is what pulls those in ahead of it on the C path.  With it,
# 597 of the 618 resolve.
PROBE-EXTRA   gdiplus.h
